<title>USA: BankAmerica seen starting worker stock plan.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica seen starting worker stock plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp is expected to announce a stock option plan for all employees Tuesday, analyst George Salem of Gerard Klauer Mattison said.</p>
<p>Earlier the bank said it will make an announcement affecting 85,000 employees at 1130 EST/1630 GMT.</p>
<p>Salem, noting that the company's stock has been doing well, said it was his guess that the announcement would be a stock option plan for all employees, something other banks have adopted.</p>
<p>BankAmerica closed Monday at 96.</p>
</text>
